              "title": "BITSAT 2024 (Memory Based Paper 3)"
            }
          ],
          "question": {
            "text": "From the top of a cliff 50 m high, the angles of depression of the top and bottom of a tower are observed to be $30^{\\circ}$ and $45^{\\circ}$. The height of tower is",
            "image": null
          },
          "options": [
            {
              "id": "Umu7i",
              "text": "50 m",
              "image": null,
              "isCorrect": false
            },
            {
              "id": "X8131",
              "text": "$50 \\sqrt{3} \\mathrm{~m}$",
              "image": null,
              "isCorrect": false
            },
            {
              "id": "jTyUg",
              "text": "$50(\\sqrt{3}-1) \\mathrm{m}$",
              "image": null,
              "isCorrect": false
            },
            {
              "id": "3YG2U",
              "text": "$50\\left(1-\\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{3}\\right) \\mathrm{m}$",
              "image": null,
              "isCorrect": true
            }
          ],
          "correctValue": null,
          "solution": {
            "text": "Accoding to condition,\n<img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/bitsat/S-za6gK9MOlwEMop04Bh1Vi8uXSmp7yxhyO-lxrmfco.original.fullsize.png\"/>\nLet, height of tower $=h$\nIn $\\triangle A B D, \\quad \\tan 45^{\\circ}=\\frac{A B}{B D} \\Rightarrow B D=50 \\mathrm{~m}$\nNow, In $\\triangle A C C^{\\prime}$\n$\\begin{aligned}\n& & \\tan 30^{\\circ} & =\\frac{A C^{\\prime}}{C^{\\prime} C} \\\\\n\\Rightarrow & & \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{3}} & =\\frac{50-h}{50} \\\\\n\\Rightarrow & & 50 & =50 \\sqrt{3}-h \\sqrt{3} \\\\\n\\Rightarrow & & h \\sqrt{3} & =50(\\sqrt{3}-1) \\\\\n& & h & =50\\left(1-\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{3}}\\right) \\\\\n& & & =50\\left(1-\\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{3}\\right) \\mathrm{m}\n\\end{aligned}$",
            "image": null
          },
          "videoSolution": null,
          "syllabusCategory": "noChange",
          "questionStructure": [
            "default"
          ],
          "previousYear": {
            "_id": "67726ce6d221dc77889e6416",
