          ],
          "type": "singleCorrect",
          "level": 1,
          "question": {
            "text": "A house subtends a right angle at the window of a opposite house and the angle of elevation of the window from the bottom of the first house is $60$. If the distance between two houses be $6 \\mathrm{~m}$, then the height of the first house is",
            "image": null
          },
          "options": [
            {
              "id": "44nHh",
              "text": "\r\n$8 \\sqrt{3} \\mathrm{~m}$\r\n",
              "isCorrect": true,
              "image": null
            },
            {
              "id": "rf0NQ",
              "text": "\r\n$6 \\sqrt{3} \\mathrm{~m}$\r\n",
              "isCorrect": false,
              "image": null
            },
            {
              "id": "1fL75",
              "text": "\r\n$4 \\sqrt{3} \\mathrm{~m}$\r\n",
              "isCorrect": false,
              "image": null
            },
            {
              "id": "cvxDk",
              "text": "\r\nNone of these",
              "isCorrect": false,
              "image": null
            }
          ],
          "correctValue": null,
          "solution": {
            "text": "Let $P Q$ be the house subtending a right angle at the window $B$ of opposite house $A B$\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/bitsat/0V7dsPYHXJPSlfmOThYsY38RGsVYM4qnm7QqqLpWp0s.original.fullsize.png\"><br>\r\nIn $\\triangle P A B$, we have \r\n$\\tan 60^{\\circ}=\\frac{A B}{6}=A B=6 \\sqrt{3} \\mathrm{~m}$\r\nIn $\\triangle C B Q$, we have\r\n$\\tan 30^{\\circ}=\\frac{h-C P}{B C}$\r\n$\\begin{array}{ll}\\Rightarrow & \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{3}}=\\frac{h-6 \\sqrt{3}}{6} \\quad[\\because A B=C P, B C=A P] \\\\ \\Rightarrow & h=6\\left(\\sqrt{3}+\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{3}}\\right) \\\\ \\Rightarrow & h=8 \\sqrt{3} \\mathrm{~m}\\end{array}$",
            "image": null
          },
          "videoSolution": null,
          "questionLabels": [],
          "syllabusCategory": "noChange",
          "questionStructure": [
            "default"
          ],
          "previousYear": {
