        {
          "_id": "64c0e81b6f5bfc7ab78aeaa8",
          "previousYearPapers": [
            {
              "_id": "61a8bf0fc821b6514e527d7e",
              "examId": "615d7713c52ffa3c944600e3",
              "heldOn": "2020-04-30T09:00:00.000Z",
              "isVisible": true,
              "shortName": "2020",
              "title": "BITSAT 2020"
            }
          ],
          "type": "singleCorrect",
          "level": 2,
          "question": {
            "text": "$\\mathrm{ABC}$ is a triangular park with $\\mathrm{AB}=\\mathrm{AC}=100 \\mathrm{~m} . \\mathrm{A}$ TV tower stands at the mid-point of $\\mathrm{BC}$. The angles of elevation of the top of the tower at A, B, C are $45^{\\circ}, 60^{\\circ}, 60^{\\circ}$ respectively. The height of the tower is",
            "image": null
          },
          "options": [
            {
              "id": "npMLF",
              "text": "$50 \\mathrm{~m}$",
              "isCorrect": false,
              "image": null
            },
            {
              "id": "fRvfP",
              "text": "$50 \\sqrt{3} \\mathrm{~m}$",
              "isCorrect": true,
              "image": null
            },
            {
              "id": "jiM2l",
              "text": "$50 \\sqrt{2} \\mathrm{~m}$",
              "isCorrect": false,
              "image": null
            },
            {
              "id": "cc6bS",
              "text": "$50(3-\\sqrt{3}) \\mathrm{m}$",
              "isCorrect": false,
              "image": null
            }
          ],
          "correctValue": null,
          "solution": {
            "text": "$\\tan 45^{\\circ}=\\frac{\\mathrm{PQ}}{\\mathrm{AQ}}=\\frac{\\mathrm{h}}{\\mathrm{AQ}} \\Rightarrow \\mathrm{h}=\\mathrm{AQ}$\r\n\r\nWhere $\\mathrm{PQ}$ is tower and $\\mathrm{ABC}$ is the park, with $\\mathrm{Q}$ being mid point of the side $\\mathrm{BC}$ and $\\mathrm{PQ}=\\mathrm{h}$ Also, $A Q^{2}+B Q^{2}=100^{2}$\r\n\r\n$\\Rightarrow \\mathrm{h}^{2}+\\mathrm{h}^{2} \\cot ^{2} 60^{\\circ}=100^{2}$\r\n\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/bitsat/tuAM6FNFOsmKk75aDThfd9hkBNGpcAj1vMCBk-QdOjY.original.fullsize.png\"><br>\r\n\r\n$\\Rightarrow \\mathrm{h}^{2}\\left[1+\\frac{1}{3}\\right]=100^{2}$\r\n\r\n$\\Rightarrow \\mathrm{h}^{2}=\\frac{3 \\times 100^{2}}{4} \\Rightarrow \\mathrm{h}=50 \\sqrt{3}$",
            "image": null
          },
          "videoSolution": null,
